Subject: [PATCH 19/23] testsuite: Add Bugzilla reporter attribution to
 libgomp.fortran/pr120286.f90 [PR fortran/120286]

Retrospective attribution header added as part of a manual
Bugzilla-provenance audit on 2026-04-22 (meta-repo tracking commit
40f0a94; GitHub issues on krystophny/gcc-dev).  The existing GCC
Fortran testsuite convention (see pr113363.f90, pdt_50.f03,
arrayio_4.f90) uses an in-file "! Contributed by ..." line; practice
is inconsistent and attribution is not strictly required for small
Bugzilla reducers, but we are adding it retroactively for provenance
safety and completeness.  No behavioural change.

Assisted-by: Claude (Anthropic)
Assisted-by: GPT (OpenAI)

	PR fortran/120286

libgomp/ChangeLog:

	* testsuite/libgomp.fortran/pr120286.f90: Add reporter attribution header.

Signed-off-by: Christopher Albert <albert@tugraz.at>
